; What gets priced is the first posting written in either of the two
; commodities left over. A commodity the entry already nets to zero is out of
; the count, so this is an exchange of pounds for francs and the euro legs
; have nothing to do with it.
2026-01-01 Two movements, one settled
    assets:eur     100 EUR
    equity:x      -100 EUR
    assets:gbp      10 GBP
    assets:chf     -12 CHF
